# THE WORKSHOP (2026-09-27, deed 1630): Notebooks/ became Workshop/ and
# Playground/ became personal/. Every Notebooks/ line above STAYS, on
# purpose: git renames tracked files only, so a checkout that pulls the
# rename keeps its ignored tiers under Notebooks/ until a hand mv, and a
# sweeping git add -A must not reach them there; and during the move
# itself both trees are ignored. The lines below are the same rules under
# the new name.
Workshop/data/.onboarded
Workshop/Untitled.ipynb
Workshop/Client_Work/
Workshop/Deliverables/
Workshop/Shared/
Workshop/personal/
Workshop/Playground/
Workshop/Educational_Notebooks/
Workshop/corporate/
Workshop/corporate
# THE THREE TIERS ARE THE WHOLE OF Workshop/ (2026-09-28): corporate/,
# personal/ and shared/, each ignored whole, and nothing else lives there;
# the starter notebooks, imports/, data/ and browser_cache/ sit under
# personal/Notebooks/. Every other Workshop/ line in this file STAYS one
# more release, for a checkout that pulls the move with its old tree in
# place. shared/ is the lowercase twin of Shared/ above.
Workshop/shared/
Workshop/_config.py
Workshop/Onboarding.ipynb
Workshop/Advanced_Notebooks/Whatsa_Lambda.ipynb
Workshop/Advanced_Notebooks/01_URLinspector.ipynb
Workshop/Advanced_Notebooks/02_FAQuilizer.ipynb
Workshop/Advanced_Notebooks/03_GAPalyzer.ipynb
