# AI Keychain persistent memory - survives application resets

# Browser automation outputs - keep these local only
# CACHE HOLDS WHAT THE PAGE HELD. A `?URL` capture of an authenticated admin
# form lands every rendered field value on disk here, credentials included
# (2026-09-11: a live basic-auth blob and a crawler token in one seo.md).
# Gitignored is not scrubbed: these files are readable by anything with the
# path, and a `!` probe that globs them can lift a value straight into a
# payload. Grep before widening a probe's glob.
browser_cache/

# Browser automation temp scripts - disposable one-offs
*_automation_summary.txt
*_automation_targets.py
